 n house of photography and lens-based media\, is selecting work for its 20
 27 biennale\, PLAY!\, curated by Marijn Bril and Grazyna Siedlecka. The bi
 ennale opens in September 2027 at locations across Groningen\, Friesland a
 nd Drenthe and will show around 75 artists.\n\nOrganisation: Noorderlicht\
 nLocation: Groningen\, Friesland and Drenthe\, the Netherlands. No nationa
 lity or residence restriction is stated.\nAward: Selected artists receive 
 an artist fee (amount not published). Noorderlicht pays for production: pr
 inting and framing\, insurance and transport. Entry fee EUR 5 per project.
 \nDuration: Biennale opens September 2027 (exact dates not published)\n\nM
 ore: https://noorderlicht.com/updates/open-call-noorderlicht-bi%C3%ABnnale
 -play-2027?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
