 imizing Digital Design in Gambling (18 months)
DESCRIPTION:Full-time postdoc in the Human-Technology Interaction group on 
 UI-PRIG\, a two-year project with the Trimbos Institute on how online gamb
 ling platforms present risk information. The work centres on building two 
