 anLab (generative-AI mock-up sites for experiments)\, and running user stu
 dies.\n\nOrganisation: Eindhoven University of Technology\, Department of 
 Industrial Engineering and Innovation Sciences\nLocation: Eindhoven\, Neth
 erlands\nAward: EUR 4\,422 to EUR 5\,760 gross a month (scale 10\, full-ti
 me)\, plus 8% holiday allowance and 8.3% year-end bonus\nDuration: 18 mont
 hs\, full-time\, fixed term\n\nMore: https://www.tue.nl/en/working-at-tue/
